    [1mendpoint[0m.
  - Named consumers that break on the rename: the web app, the iOS app 3.2+, and the nightly partner export. The iOS
    clients are already shipped — they can't be redeployed in step with the server.
  - [38;5;153mdata/users.json[39m uses [38;5;153mid[39m internally; only the response mapping carries [38;5;153muserId[39m, so nothing else in this repo needs
    touching. The breakage is entirely external.

  So the consistency win is real, but as written this is a breaking contract change to three consumers, against a
  documented versioning policy.

